+## Usage reported to `afterModelResponse`
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits, and the usage it receives covers every provider call of the turn, so a turn that ran tools reports the sum of all its rounds rather than the last one ([validated by: covers every provider call of a turn driven through two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/turnUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L57)).
+- A round whose provider reports no usage adds nothing to that sum, the rounds that did report are still counted, and a turn in which no round reported usage passes no usage at all ([validated by: counts the rounds that reported usage, and reports none when no round did](../../src/orchestration/turnUsage.acceptance.test.ts#L64)).
+
